    - target: {fileID: 1332869996995723780, guid: eeafd605329c524488d0efa3082ef60b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "\u7AD9\u957F"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2751735736296460033, guid: eeafd605329c524488d0efa3082ef60b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "\u3010December Offline Meetup Notice\u3011\n\r\nHello everyone~!\r\nThe
        last event happened during midterms, and many people said they missed it
        because of assignments and exams\u2014what a pity TT\r\n\r\nNow that the
        holidays are coming, everyone should have more free time. So we decided to
        hold another meetup!\r\nSame as before, just come chat, share your recent
        creations or life updates\u2014no pressure~\r\n\r\nHope to see more familiar
        names this time, and new friends are also very welcome. Thanks to everyone
        who volunteered to help! We\u2019ve also prepared lots of free goodies for
        everyone. See you next Saturday!\r\n\r\nTime: Next Saturday, 14:00\r\nLocation:
        Central Area \xB7 Central Exchange Hall, Level 1 open space\r\nHow to join:
        Voluntary participation\r\n\r\nActivities include:\r\nCharacter setting sharing\r\nWork
        sharing\r\nFree discussion\r\nOn-site games\r\nFree item exchange (optional)\r\nGroup
        photo (optional)\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re interested, please leave a comment
        with the number of people so we can plan better. I really can\u2019t wait
        OwO\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3191641678273846078, guid: eeafd605329c524488d0efa3082ef60b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.y
      value: 515.18
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
