  m_Text: 'Behind every treatment lies a foundation of continuous research and innovation.


    Our
    in-house laboratory is dedicated to exploring next-generation regenerative techniques,
    focusing on cellular optimization and long-term stability.


    By integrating
    research with clinical practice, we aim to deliver solutions that are both scientifically
    grounded and precisely engineered.'
